ypeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Passages to Edron, Thais, Venore, Darashia, Ankrahmun, Yalahar and Port Hope.</li><li>Oh, these unpredictable storms.</li><li>Oh, my poor ship.</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>On his ship at the <a href=\"#/wiki/Liberty%20Bay\">Liberty Bay</a> docks and eastern <a href=\"#/wiki/Goroma\">Goroma</a>  (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32161,32558,6\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32161, 32558, 6)</a>).\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Passage to</th>\n<th>Cost (gp)</th>\n<th>Notes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">90</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">200</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">170</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Goroma\">Goroma</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">500</td>\n<td>After completing <i>Access to Goroma</i> in <a href=\"#/quest/the-shattered-isles-quest\">The Shattered Isles Quest</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Port%20Hope\">Port Hope</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">50</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">180</td>\n<td>You have ~8% chance to strand on <a href=\"#/wiki/Goroma\">Goroma</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Travora</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">1,000</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">180</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Yalahar\">Yalahar</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">275</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><small>Completing the Postman Quest gives 10 gp discount to most destinations.</small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>","quests":["20-years-a-cook-quest","assassin-outfits-quest","between-the-lines-quest","feaster-of-souls-quest","fire-from-the-earth-mini-world-change","illuminator-outfits-quest","killing-in-the-name-of-quest","marlin-trophy-quest","oriental-outfits-quest","poltergeist-outfits-quest","revenant-outfits-quest","summoner-outfits-quest","the-ice-islands-quest","the-lightbearer","the-shattered-isles-quest"],"pos":{"x":32161,"y":32556,"z":6}}